
~ title

Desert Winds

=> END


~ start

Taking a short stop, you notice the wind picking up, and the sand slowly rises with it. You are in a very dry and sandy area.
In the distance, you see dark, sweeping clouds, swathing the land before you in darkness.
	[br][br]A Sandstorm is approaching!
	[br][br]You do not know how long it will last.

#What will you do?

set EventManager.temp["strength"] = 1

=> END


~ action

- Wait it out
	%.50
		The sandstorm whirs away around you, growing in strength.
		set EventManager.temp["strength"] = EventManager.temp.strength + 0.5
		=> action
	%.50 The fierce winds begin to weaken.

#- Find shelter

- Continue on
	%.45
		The sandstorm whirs away around you, growing in strength.
		set EventManager.temp["strength"] = EventManager.temp.strength + 1
		=> action
	%.35 The fierce winds begin to weaken.
	%.20 You manage to find some shelther.

do Game.skip_hour(0.5 * EventManager.temp.strength)
do Game.player.apply_stat(StatType.HEALTH, -3 * EventManaer.temp.strength)
do Game.player.apply_stat(StatType.HUNGER, -1.5 * EventManager.temp.strength)

=> END